From: 21pages <sunboeasy@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] fix nvenc reconfigure blur

Ported to FFmpeg 9.0.2 for RDC: unchanged, regenerated for the new offset.
FFmpeg 9 reconfig_encoder still resets the encoder and forces an IDR on a
bitrate change, so the fix is still needed.

diff --git a/libavcodec/nvenc.c b/libavcodec/nvenc.c
index 9203fb6..69d5f06 100644
--- a/libavcodec/nvenc.c
+++ b/libavcodec/nvenc.c
@@ -2850,8 +2850,8 @@ static void reconfig_encoder(AVCodecContext *avctx, const AVFrame *frame)
         }
 
         if (reconfig_bitrate) {
-            params.resetEncoder = 1;
-            params.forceIDR = 1;
+            params.resetEncoder = 0;
+            params.forceIDR = 0;
 
             needs_encode_config = 1;
             needs_reconfig = 1;
